        "created_at": "2015-01-07T18:21:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've got a reference sheet on my site that has all the heroes grouped with their alts (so that once you've decided you're in a Wraith mood, you can choose which flavor sounds best). &nbsp;The sheet does not have their icons or difficulty. &nbsp;The second reference sheet has all the villains grouped by difficulty, and then all the environments. &nbsp;My gaming group uses these sheets to help us decide who to play against who where, since the number of choices is so high now.</p>",
